# IMP001 - UI/UX Issue on Product Hover Animation


## Problem Description
When hovering over a product, an orange overlay animation appears and the product image disappears, affecting visual clarity.


## Impact on User
This behavior may confuse the user, as the product image is hidden during interaction, reducing clarity about the selected item.


## Recommendation
Improve the hover behavior by:
- Keeping the product image visible during "Add to cart" interaction
- Reducing or removing the overlay animation effect
- Ensuring clear visual feedback when selecting a product


## Expected Benefit
- Improved user experience (UX)
- Clearer product selection process
- Better visual feedback during cart interaction


